{"version":1,"content":"<p>《第63屆金馬獎》今晚（22日）於台北流行音樂中心舉行，每年的《金馬獎》總是吸引最多重量級的國際嘉賓來台觀禮或表演，成為含金量最高的三金之一，今屆7大亮點帶你一文睇晒這項台灣影壇盛事。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1.柯煒林首</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T03:01:57.383261+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T02:19:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T02:55:21.055006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T02:55:21.055006+00:00","content_hash":"5bc40d51316121462b1aab5d7d6e2eb849322bb268bba44fec38d1baf2776faf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}